<title>USA: Christian County, Ky., forwards, yields 6.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Christian County, Ky., forwards, yields 6.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robinson-Humphrey Co, Inc said it priced $16.25 million of Christian County, Ky., hospital revenue and refunding bonds, Series 1997A, with a top yield of 6.10 percent in 2013.</p>
